  "learningOutcomes": "By the end of the sub-strand, the learner should be able to:\na) describe ways through which plants eliminate waste products,\nb) demonstrate ways through which plants eliminate waste products,\nc) outline the economic importance of plant excretory products,\nd) recognise the importance of excretory products in plants.",
