  "drivingQuestion": "DRIVING QUESTION: How do trees and crops clear out their metabolic wastes without any organs or excretory systems, and why are these waste products worth so much money in our markets?\n\nKICD KEY INQUIRY QUESTIONS:\n1. How do plants eliminate waste products?\n2. How do humans use plant excretory products?",
